e fastest-growing U.S. population centers, operates from all major West Coast and Gulf Coast ports to Eastern gateways, connects with Canada's rail systems, and is the only railroad serving all six major Mexico gateways. Union Pacific provides value to customers by delivering products in a safe, reliable, fuel-efficient, and environmentally responsible manner.","zh":"聯合太平洋鐵路公司是聯合太平洋公司的主要營運公司。聯合太平洋鐵路公司是美國最受認可的公司之一，透過鐵路連接美國西部三分之二的地區的 23 個州，為全球供應鏈提供了關鍵的一環。該鐵路的多元化業務組合包括散裝、工業和優質業務。聯合太平洋鐵路為美國許多成長最快的人口中心提供服務，從所有主要的西海岸和墨西哥灣沿岸港口到東部門戶，與加拿大的鐵路系統相連，是唯一一條為墨西哥所有六個主要門戶提供服務的鐵路。聯合太平洋透過以安全、可靠、節能且對環境負責的方式交付產品，為客戶提供價值。"},{"en":"Union Pacific Corporation was incorporated in Utah in 1969 and maintains its principal executive offices at 1400 Douglas Street, Omaha, NE 68179. The telephone number at that address is (402) 544-5000. The common stock of Union Pacific Corporation is listed on the New York Stock Exchange (NYSE) under the symbol \"UNP\".","zh":"聯合太平洋公司於 1969 年在猶他州註冊成立，其主要執行辦公室位於 1400 Douglas Street, Omaha, NE 68179。該地址的電話號碼為 (402) 544-5000。聯合太平洋公司的普通股在紐約證券交易所（NYSE）上市，代號為「UNP」。"},{"en":"For purposes of this report, unless the context otherwise requires, all references herein to \"Union Pacific\", \"UPC\", \"Corporation\", \"Company\", \"we\", \"us\", and \"our\" shall mean Union Pacific Corporation and its subsidiaries, including Union Pacific Railroad Company, which we separately refer to as \"UPRR\" or the \"Railroad\".","zh":"就本報告而言，除非上下文另有要求，本文中所有提及的「聯合太平洋公司」、「UPC」、「公司」、「公司」、「我們」和「我們的」均指聯合太平洋公司及其子公司，包括聯合太平洋鐵路公司，我們分別稱之為「UPRR」或「鐵路」。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Cargo & Freight","val":23220000000,"zh":"貨物及貨運"},{"name":"Product & Service Other","val":1290000000,"zh":"產品與服務 其他"}],"total":24510000000}},"peers":["NSC","CSX","CNI","HON","DE"]}}